  "notes": "Agent re-read after the Code Health refactor, 2026-11-07, under the owner directive transcribed in verification/reviews/rulings/agent-rereview-after-refactor-2026-11-07.md. This record is NOT an owner signature: it attests the agent's substantive reading only. Read proxy.client_crl_next_update_gate (client_crl_publication.rs, no diff), proxy.client_crl_reload_republish, proxy.client_revocation_currency and proxy.retired_plane_cadence_retraction. The production changes are projections of the channel plan: ChannelEstablishmentPlan now exposes crl_paths, crl_reload_cadence_secs, currency_bound (which calls credential_currency_bound over the same two fields), credential_window and handshake_capacity, and tls_plane/mod.rs, client_revocation_posture.rs and crl_reload_worker call them where they read the fields. The latch that retracts the cadence, the succession check and the evidence constructor are unchanged lines. The tests build their plans through channel_plan with the same CRL paths, cadence and window values. Dependency THM-0054 is REVIEWED. The claim holds. The mutation lane was not run, and no test was run. Evidence class as registered (V0).",
